<html><body><h1>Prompt injection in the wild</h1><p>Attackers embed strings like <code>IGNORE ALL PREVIOUS INSTRUCTIONS</code> and <code>&lt;|im_start|&gt;system</code> in emails to hijack LLM agents.</p><p>Our advice: fence untrusted data and gate every action. Full writeup online.</p></body></html>
